  "item_short_desc": "<p>Enhance your workout with our Physical Training T-Shirt. Engineered with a high-performing blend of 86% nylon / 14% spandex, the PT T-Shirt wicks sweat away for optimum comfort. Featuring Rothco&rsquo;s rapid moisture control fabric, sweat is swiftly transferred to the top layer, allowing for a quick dry. This prevents sweat from soaking through the military shirt, so it won&rsquo;t stick to you during your training sessions.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133370",
  "description": "<p>Enhance your workout with our Physical Training T-Shirt. Engineered with a high-performing blend of 86% nylon / 14% spandex, the PT T-Shirt wicks sweat away for optimum comfort. Featuring Rothco&rsquo;s rapid moisture control fabric, sweat is swiftly transferred to the top layer, allowing for a quick dry. This prevents sweat from soaking through the military shirt, so it won&rsquo;t stick to you during your training sessions. Lightweight &amp; Breathable: These performance shirts feature a soft yet durable fabric blend that ensures a comfortable fit and feel while enduring intense physical training, no matter the time or location. Ready for Action: The gym shirt consists of reinforced seams at the collar, sleeves, and bottom hem to further enhance the physical training shirt&rsquo;s durability. With a tag-less neck label, you are free to move around without any itches or scratches. Versatile Wear: Whether it&rsquo;s an early morning ruck or an afternoon at the gym, these tough t-shirts are great for high-intensity workouts, training sessions, exercise classes, everyday wear, and more. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Gear up with a matching pair of Rothco&rsquo;s Physical Training Shorts for a cohesive workout.</p>",
